    "Each run used a separately generated padding seed. Token targets match, but prompt contents are not bit-identical and 128K API accounting differs by one token in some arms.",
    "Standalone prefill uses a fixed 10-second window checked between requests, so sample count depends on request duration; 128K has N=1 in every arm and chunk4096 also has N=1 at 64K.",
    "Runtime JIT occurred inside one measured long-context sample in every arm, and individual sample latencies were not retained.",
    "These are directional single-run comparisons, not repeated warm steady-state estimates.",
    "Observed KV capacity includes profiler/reservation variance and is not a guaranteed monotonic function of chunk size."
